{"seq":12,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T04:49:20.536Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ce5d4df52618eb77ee42a6beaf7d5e85f7e1672885663beb93969720022ef056","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests show. Two points are my inference, so please confirm them in the CRM before they go on the board slide.\n\n**Current owners**\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. The 8/3 and 9/30 digests call it Gideon's biggest account. Earlier digests had Nadia Fennimore as its owner.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 7/7/25 and 12/1/25 digests call it Gideon's fleet account. The 5/4/26 digest says he took over its management that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 12/1/25 and 9/30/26 digests call it Gideon's medical account. The 3/10/25 digest called it Nadia's, so the change happened in between, but no digest dates it.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** No digest I can see names an owner. Nadia is hosting its gate clerk training, but that isn't ownership.\n\n**Vantorre Group change date:** 4 May 2026. Moss's 5/4/26 digest says Nadia's old industrial account was reassigned in the CRM effective that day, and that Mateo Quiroga was told of the primary contact change. The digest doesn't name the account. I matched it to Vantorre Group because of the Allentown plant, Mateo as the contact, and Gideon's 7/1 message in this channel linking \"Nadia's old industrial account\" to Vantorre's roster. Please confirm the date in the CRM."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
